  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and variance of a random variable $\\mathrm{X}$ having binomial distribution are 4 and 2 respectively, then $\\mathrm{P}$ $(\\mathrm{X}=1)$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "V54xL",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{1}{4}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "kd1ez",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{1}{32}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gi9EM",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{1}{16}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "8703a",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{1}{8}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left.\\begin{array}{c}\\mathrm{np}=4 \\\\ \\mathrm{npq}=2\\end{array}\\right\\} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{q}=\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\mathrm{p}=\\frac{1}{2}, \\mathrm{n}=8$\n$\\mathrm{p}(\\mathrm{X}=1)={ }^8 \\mathrm{C}_1\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^7=8 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2^8}=\\frac{1}{2^5}=\\frac{1}{32}$",
    "image": null
  },
